{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-jer-4-1","title":"Jeremiah 4:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 God calls Israel by his promise. 3 He exhorts Judah to repentance by fearful judgments. 19 A grievous lamentation for Judah.</p>\n<p>wilt return. 4; 3:12,22 return. 3:1,14; Isa 31:6; Ho 7:16; 14:1; Joe 2:12 put away. Ge 35:2; De 27:15; Jos 24:14; Jud 10:16; 1Sa 7:3; 2Ki 23:13,24 2Ch 15:8; Eze 11:18; 18:13; 20:7,8; 43:9; Ho 2:2; Eph 4:22-31 then shalt. 15:4; 22:3-5; 24:9; 25:5; 36:3; 2Ch 33:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-4-2","title":"Jeremiah 4:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>shalt swear. 5:2; De 10:20; Isa 45:23; 48:1,2; 65:16 in truth. 9:24; 1Ki 3:6; Ps 99:4; Ho 2:19; Zec 8:8 and the nations. Ge 22:18; Ps 72:17; Isa 65:16; Ga 3:8 and in him. 9:24; Isa 45:25; 1Co 1:31; 2Co 10:17; Php 3:3; *Gr:</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-4-3","title":"Jeremiah 4:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>Break. Ge 3:18; Ho 10:12; Mt 13:7,22; Mr 4:7,18,19; Lu 8:7,14; Ga 6:7,8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-4-4","title":"Jeremiah 4:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>take. 9:26; De 10:16; 30:6; Eze 18:31; Ro 2:28,29; Col 2:11 lest. 21:5,12; 23:19; 36:7; Le 26:28; De 32:22; Isa 30:27,28; 51:17 La 4:11; Eze 5:13-15; 6:12; 8:18; 16:38; 20:33,47,48; 21:17; 24:8,13 Am 5:6; Zep 2:2; Mr 9:43-50</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-4-5","title":"Jeremiah 4:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>Declare ye. 5:20; 9:12; 11:2 Blow. 6:1; Eze 33:2-6; Ho 8:1; Am 3:6,8 Assemble. 8:14; 35:11; Jos 10:20</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-4-6","title":"Jeremiah 4:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>the standard. 21; 50:2; 51:12,27; Isa 62:10 retire. or, strengthen. for I will. 1:13-15; 6:1,22; 21:7; 25:9 and a great. 50:22; 51:54 destruction. Heb. breaking. Zep 1:10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-4-7","title":"Jeremiah 4:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>lion. 5:6; 25:38; 49:19; 50:17,44; 2Ki 24:1; 25:1; Da 7:4 destroyer. 25:9; 27:8; Eze 21:19-21; 26:7-10; 30:10,11; Da 5:19 to. 2:15; 9:11; 26:9; 33:10; 34:22; Isa 1:7; 5:9; 6:11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-4-8","title":"Jeremiah 4:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>gird. 6:26; Isa 15:3; 22:12; 32:11; Joe 2:12,13; Am 8:10 howl. 48:20; Isa 13:6; 15:2,3; Eze 21:12; 30:2 the. Isa 5:25; 9:12,17,21; 10:4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-4-9","title":"Jeremiah 4:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>that the heart. 39:4,5; 52:7; 1Sa 25:37,38; 2Ki 25:4; Ps 102:4; Isa 19:3,11,12,16 Isa 21:3,4; 22:3-5 and the priests. 5:31; 6:13,14; 37:19; Isa 29:9,10; Eze 13:9-16; Ac 13:41</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-4-10","title":"Jeremiah 4:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>Ah. 1:6; 14:13; 32:17; Eze 11:13 surely. 14:13,14; 1Ki 22:20-23; Isa 63:17; Eze 14:9,10; Ro 1:24,26,28 2Th 2:9-12 Ye shall have. 5:12; 6:14; 8:11; 23:17; Isa 30:10; 37:35 the sword. 18; Ex 9:14; La 2:21</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-4-11","title":"Jeremiah 4:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>A. 23:19; 30:23,24; 51:1; Isa 27:8; 64:6; Eze 17:10; 19:12; Ho 13:3,15 daughter. 8:19; 9:1,7; 14:17; Isa 22:4; La 2:11; 3:48; 4:3,6,10 not. 51:2; Isa 41:16; Mt 3:12; Lu 3:17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-4-12","title":"Jeremiah 4:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>a full wind from those. or, a fuller wind than those. givesentence. Heb. utter judgments. 1:16; Eze 5:8; 6:11-13; 7:8,9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-4-13","title":"Jeremiah 4:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>Behold. Isa 13:5; 19:1; Na 1:3; Mt 24:30; Re 1:7 his chariots. Isa 5:28; 66:15; Na 2:3,4 his horses. De 28:49; La 4:19; Da 7:4; Ho 8:1; Hab 1:8 Woe. 31; 10:19</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-4-14","title":"Jeremiah 4:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>wash. Isa 1:16-19; 55:7; Eze 18:31; Mt 12:33; 15:19,20; 23:26,27 Lu 11:39; Jas 4:8 How long. 13:27; Ps 66:18; 119:113; Pr 1:22; Ac 8:22; Ro 1:21; 1Co 3:20</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-4-15","title":"Jeremiah 4:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>a voice. 6:1; 8:16; Jud 18:29; 20:1 mount Ephraim. Jos 17:15; 20:7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-4-16","title":"Jeremiah 4:16","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":16,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":16},"content":"<p>ye. 6:18; 31:10; 50:2; Isa 34:1 watchers. 17; 5:6; 16:6; 39:1 from. 5:15; De 28:49-52; Isa 39:3 give out. 2:15; Eze 21:22</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-4-17","title":"Jeremiah 4:17","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":17,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":17},"content":"<p>keepers. 6:2,3; 2Ki 25:1-4; Isa 1:8; Lu 19:43,44; 21:20-24 because. 5:23; Ne 9:26,30; Isa 1:20-23; 30:9; La 1:8,18; Eze 2:3-7 Da 9:7-19</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-4-18","title":"Jeremiah 4:18","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":18,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":18},"content":"<p>Thy way. 2:17,19; 5:19; 6:19; 26:19; Job 20:5-16; Ps 107:17; Pr 1:31; 5:22 Isa 50:1 it reacheth. 10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-4-19","title":"Jeremiah 4:19","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":19,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":19},"content":"<p>My bowels. 9:1,10; 13:17; 14:17,18; 23:9; 48:31,32; Ps 119:53,136; Isa 15:5 Isa 16:11; 21:3; 22:4; La 1:16; 2:11; 3:48-51; Da 7:15,28; 8:27 Hab 3:16; Lu 19:41,42; Ro 9:2,3; 10:1; Ga 4:19 my very. Heb. the walls of my. O my. Ge 49:6; Jud 5:21; Ps 16:2; 42:5,6; 103:1; 116:7; 146:1 sound. 5,21; Am 3:6; Zep 1:15,16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-4-20","title":"Jeremiah 4:20","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":20,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":20},"content":"<p>upon destruction. 6; 17:18; Le 26:18,21,24,28; Ps 42:7; Isa 13:6; La 3:47 Eze 7:25,26; 14:21; Joe 1:15; Mt 10:28; 2Th 1:9 suddenly. 10:19,20; Isa 33:20; 54:2; La 2:6-9; Hab 3:7 in. Ex 33:5; Nu 16:21,45; Ps 72:19; Isa 47:9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-4-21","title":"Jeremiah 4:21","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":21,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":21},"content":"<p>How long. 14 shall I. 5,6,19; 6:1; 2Ch 35:25; 36:3,6,7,10,17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-4-22","title":"Jeremiah 4:22","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":22,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":22},"content":"<p>For my. 5:4,21; 8:7-9; De 32:6,28; Ps 14:1-4; Isa 1:3; 6:9,10; 27:11 Isa 29:10-12; 42:19,20; Ho 4:1,6; Mt 23:16-26; Ro 1:22; 3:11 they have. Ho 5:4; Joh 16:3; Ro 1:28; 1Co 1:20,21 they are wise. 2Sa 13:3; 16:21-23; Mic 2:1; Lu 16:8; Ro 16:19; 1Co 14:20</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-4-23","title":"Jeremiah 4:23","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":23,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":23},"content":"<p>the earth. 9:10; Ge 1:2; Isa 24:19-23; Re 20:11 the heavens. Isa 5:30; 13:10; Eze 32:7,8; Joe 2:10,30,31; 3:15,16; Am 8:9 Mt 24:29,35; Mr 13:24,25; Lu 21:25,26; Ac 2:19,20</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-4-24","title":"Jeremiah 4:24","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":24,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":24},"content":"<p>mountains. 8:16; 10:10; Jud 5:4,5; 1Ki 19:11; Ps 18:7; 77:18; 97:4; 114:4-7 Isa 5:25; Eze 38:20; Mic 1:4; Na 1:5,6; Hab 3:6,10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-4-25","title":"Jeremiah 4:25","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":25,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":25},"content":"<p>there was no man. Ho 4:3; Zep 1:2,3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-4-26","title":"Jeremiah 4:26","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":26,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":26},"content":"<p>the fruitful. 12:4; 14:2-6; De 29:23-28; Ps 76:7; 107:34; Isa 5:9,10; 7:20-25 Mic 3:12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-4-27","title":"Jeremiah 4:27","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":27,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":27},"content":"<p>The. 7; 7:34; 12:11; 18:16; 2Ch 36:21; Isa 6:11,12; 24:1,3-12 Eze 6:14; 33:28 yet. 5:10,18; 30:11; 46:28; Le 26:44; Isa 24:12,13; Eze 11:13; Am 9:8,9 Ro 9:27-29; 11:1-7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-4-28","title":"Jeremiah 4:28","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":28,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":28},"content":"<p>the earth. 23-26; 12:4; 23:10; Isa 24:4; 33:8,9; Ho 4:3; Joe 1:10 the heavens. Isa 5:30; 34:4; 50:3; Joe 2:30,31; Mt 27:45; Mr 15:33; Lu 23:44 Re 6:12 because. 7:16; 14:11,12; 15:1-9; Nu 23:19; 1Sa 15:29; Isa 14:24-27; 46:10,11 Eze 24:14; Ho 13:14; Eph 1:9,11; Heb 7:21</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-4-29","title":"Jeremiah 4:29","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":29,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":29},"content":"<p>shall flee. 39:4-6; 52:7; 2Ki 25:4-7; Isa 30:17; Am 9:1 they shall go. 1Sa 13:6; 2Ch 33:11; Isa 2:19-21; Lu 23:30; Re 6:15-17 every. 27</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-4-30","title":"Jeremiah 4:30","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":30,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":30},"content":"<p>And when. 5:31; 13:21; Isa 10:3; 20:6; 33:14; Heb 2:3 Though. Eze 23:40,41; 28:9,13; Re 17:4 face. Heb. eyes. 2Ki 9:30 in vain. 22:20-22; La 1:2,19; 4:17; Eze 16:36-41; 23:9,10,22-24,28,29 Re 17:2,13,16-18</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-4-31","title":"Jeremiah 4:31","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":31,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":31},"content":"<p>I have heard. 6:24; 13:21; 22:23; 30:6; 48:41; 49:22,24; 50:43; Isa 13:8; 21:3 Ho 13:13; 1Th 5:3 the voice. 6:2,23; Mt 21:5 spreadeth. Isa 1:15; La 1:17 Woe. 10:19; 15:18; 45:2; Ps 120:5; Isa 6:5; Mic 7:1; 1Co 9:16 for my. Ge 27:46; Job 10:1 because. 14:18; 18:21; La 1:20; 2:21; Eze 9:5,6; 23:46,47</p>"}]}